# Normalise to LF in the repository regardless of the checkout platform. Development
# happens on Windows; CI and every deployment target are Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary and fixture files must not be touched. Fuzz corpora in particular are
# byte-exact by definition, and a CRLF conversion silently corrupts them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz  binary
*.qcow2 binary
**/testdata/fuzz/** -text
